("QIH","FDA product code QIH","Automated radiological image processing software (21 CFR 892.2050, Class II); often listed for software and AI functions of an imaging system.",36),
("CADe","computer-aided detection","Software that marks image regions likely to contain a lesion for the reader to review.",36),
