("HF","human factors","How users interact with a device; FDA expects a use-related risk analysis and, if critical tasks exist, validation testing (IEC 62366-1).",36,[36]),
("HFE","human factors engineering","Applying knowledge of human abilities and limits to device design and validation; documented in the HFE/usability engineering report.",36),
("URRA","use-related risk analysis","Analysis of user tasks, possible use errors and their harms that identifies the critical tasks for human-factors validation.",36),
