("MDR","Medical Device Regulation (EU); medical device report (U.S.)","In EU context: Regulation (EU) 2017/745 on classification, technical documentation and CE marking. In U.S. postmarket context: a report of a death, serious injury or malfunction under 21 CFR 803, stored in MAUDE.",36),
